0+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>舜宇光学半年报：手机利润掉了2.8亿，机器人翻倍扛住</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-08/ART-8100-2500-30700431.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">fe024ff67e9a</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>【深度】双光束紫外可见分光光度计为高精度光学分析仪器 我国市场竞争较为激烈</title><link>https://optics.ofweek.com/2026-06/ART-250003-8420-30691262.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">daf47e4be680</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 光电频道</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>新思科技获准向是德科技出售光学解决方案部门</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/212/a1298390.html</link><description>新思科技（Synopsys）宣布已获得所有相关监管机构的最终批准，将正式推进此前已公布的业务剥离计划：将旗下光学解决方案部门（Optical Solutions Group）及 PowerArtist 业务出售给是德科技（Keysight）。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">5db61d7aaa75</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_IT资讯</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>产品合集 | 9月来CIOE看夜视仪与红外测试测量设备如何赋能多场景精准作业</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/3003_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">6b922fe71a43</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>A milestone toward exawatt plasma optics by Raman amplification</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41566-026-01989-x</link><description>Nature Photonics, Published online: 28 August 2026; doi:10.1038/s41566-026-01989-x Exawatt-to-zettawatt lasers are essential in the quest for an ultimate understanding of nature, but they are held back by the damage limits of conventional optics. A recent experiment of Raman pulse compression to terawatt power revitalizes the prospect of plasma-based optics for next-generation ultraintense lasers.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e9d1bba751e5</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>Nature Photonics</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>产品合集 | 从消费终端到高端制造，9月来CIOE看全品类光学镜头与模组解决方案</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/3002_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">1232fcbe1c34</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>Faint far-infrared radiation drives a correlated insulator-to-metal transition in magic-angle graphene</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-08-faint-infrared-insulator-metal-transition.html</link><description>One of the central ideas in modern physics is the phase transition—a sudden transformation of the state of a material. We encounter phase transitions throughout everyday life: water freezes into ice, wax melts in the warmth of a flame, and water vapor condenses into droplets on a cold window. In these familiar examples, the atoms themselves rearrange into a new structure, giving the material entirely different properties.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e59bbc8d4398</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>展商回顾 | 同济大学精密光学工程技术研究所精彩亮相，前沿光学科技成果备受瞩目</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2665_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">97138dbe3744</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>展商回顾 | 复享光学携新品膜厚测量仪亮相，引领光谱技术发展</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2663_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">a38de14953cd</guid><pubDate>2026-09-05T08:11:14.673660+00:00</pubDate><source>CIOE 中国光博会</source><category>光学元件与成像</category></item><item><title>前沿｜全波硫系模压红外镜头：重塑红外成像成本与性能核心力量</title><link>https://cioe.cn/news/2921_info.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">51377